  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d5a72b4a96b627b",
      "translationZh": "学术研究需要频繁地发现研究资源：查找论文、代码、相关模型和数据集。这通常意味着要在 arXiv、GitHub 和 Hugging Face 等平台之间切换，手动梳理它们之间的关联。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac070538d9b05e8b",
      "translationZh": "模型上下文协议（MCP）是一项允许智能体模型与外部工具和数据源通信的标准。对于研究资源发现而言，这意味着 AI 可以通过自然语言请求使用研究工具，自动完成平台切换和交叉核对。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a03215734f095567",
      "translationZh": "研究资源发现：三个抽象层次",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2740baf37986724a",
      "translationZh": "与软件开发非常相似，研究资源发现也可以用抽象层次来描述。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "109c337198fc38b6",
      "translationZh": "1. 手动研究",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f33283599942506",
      "translationZh": "在最低的抽象层次上，研究人员手动搜索并交叉核对信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c998bb228ffb8a0",
      "translationZh": "在跟踪多条研究线索或开展系统性文献综述时，这种手动方式会变得低效。跨平台搜索、提取元数据和交叉核对信息等工作的重复性，自然促使人们通过脚本来实现自动化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b634db2dac2df6e8",
      "translationZh": "2. 脚本化工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d6abf73868fc871",
      "translationZh": "Python 脚本通过处理网络请求、解析响应和整理结果，实现研究发现过程的自动化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b747953a412a19c3",
      "translationZh": "这个研究追踪工具展示了如何利用这类脚本构建系统化的研究发现流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce3313643fcee00f",
      "translationZh": "虽然脚本比人工研究更快，但它们常常会因 API 变化、速率限制或解析错误而无法自动收集数据。如果没有人工监督，脚本可能会遗漏相关结果，或返回不完整的信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b343669e78781f4c",
      "translationZh": "3. MCP 集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a36fc4e2d43c7e99",
      "translationZh": "MCP 让 AI 系统能够通过自然语言访问这些相同的 Python 工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "983b7cbf36349c0b",
      "translationZh": "AI 会编排多个工具、填补信息缺口，并对结果进行推理：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17b9b8b87a929cd3",
      "translationZh": "这可以看作是脚本编程之上的一个额外抽象层，其中的“编程语言”是自然语言。这遵循 Software 3.0 的类比：用自然语言描述的研究方向就是软件实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf1dd7a9fe20fe62",
      "translationZh": "这也有与脚本编程相同的注意事项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3b6ad0322734222e",
      "translationZh": "比人工研究更快，但如果没有人工指导，就容易出错",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e707ff0865e7a357",
      "translationZh": "质量取决于具体实现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4d9f07530f77630e",
      "translationZh": "理解底层机制（包括手动操作和脚本化操作）有助于实现得更好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "590017ead8eef748",
      "translationZh": "设置与使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c1703557b1c0d9d7",
      "translationZh": "快速设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "588138e21aedef59",
      "translationZh": "添加 Research Tracker MCP 最简单的方法是通过 Hugging Face MCP 设置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b2d6790adb94feb8",
      "translationZh": "访问 huggingface.co/settings/mcp",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b1801d3a65fb40b7",
      "translationZh": "在可用工具中搜索“research-tracker-mcp”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d3c02cee671659aa",
      "translationZh": "点击，将其添加到你的工具中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "49b24819bc021037",
      "translationZh": "按照所提供的设置说明，为你使用的具体客户端（Claude Desktop、Cursor、Claude Code、VS Code 等）进行设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c01df190882c7de3",
      "translationZh": "此工作流程利用 Hugging Face MCP 服务器，这是将 Hugging Face Spaces 用作 MCP 工具的标准方式。设置页面提供针对各客户端的配置，这些配置自动生成，并始终保持最新。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8d8cd546b58d91c3",
      "translationZh": "了解更多",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "012c919654cc77ef",
      "translationZh": "开始使用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6053fd8050339a23",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face MCP 课程——从基础知识到构建自己的工具的完整指南",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bdc3f182ef08ec3d",
      "translationZh": "MCP 官方文档——协议规范与架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0f1ce75a9f095fb",
      "translationZh": "构建你自己的工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1590eb49df38abea",
      "translationZh": "Gradio MCP 指南 - 将 Python 函数转化为 MCP 工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "914c1acf35a0c1d4",
      "translationZh": "构建 Hugging Face MCP 服务器 - 生产环境实现案例研究",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a497fe96fab2fb13",
      "translationZh": "社区：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c00489e6fa1c09b8",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Discord - MCP 开发讨论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c16e518762fc9ca",
      "translationZh": "准备好让研究发现流程自动化了吗？试试 Research Tracker MCP，或利用上述资源构建你自己的研究工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
